.git
**/target
# XMage has a real Java source package named mage/target; keep it in the image.
!Mage/src/main/java/mage/target/
!Mage/src/main/java/mage/target/**
**/db
# Mage.Common also has a legitimate Java source package named mage/db.
!Mage.Common/src/main/java/mage/db/
!Mage.Common/src/main/java/mage/db/**
**/saved
**/gamelogs
**/gamelogsJson
**/gamesHistory
Mage.Client/plugins/images
Mage.Client/plugins/plugin.data
deploy
temp
*.log
*.zip
